tom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T13:33:38-07:00","id":1116089,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1032849-what-we-know-so-far-geist-the-sin-eater-2nd-edition?p=1116040#post1116040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's definitely a good chance Geist will get a Kickstarter (unless Changeling gets a major case of Kickstarter fatigue after Dark Eras 2 which doesn't seem to do as well as Dark Eras) but the phrasing implied that Geist is certain to get a Kickstarter, and that's not the case.</div> </div> </div> </div>My phrasing implied that? Perhaps I'm misunderstanding you. I did say that if Changeling's kickstarter went well that Geist would probably get one, but I don't see where I implied that it was certain. I apologize if I caused any confusion. It was certainly not my intent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T13:51:58-07:00","id":1116098,"title":"","content":"Not yours. The post I originally responded to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-14T16:18:04-07:00","id":1116147,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1032849-what-we-know-so-far-geist-the-sin-eater-2nd-edition?p=1116098#post1116098\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not yours. The post I originally responded to.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, okay then. Thank you for letting me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T18:14:04-07:00","id":1121116,"title":"","content":"With GenCon rapidly approaching, maybe we'll hear something about Geist 2E from the GenCon brochure or dev blogs once the amazing chaos of the con winds down. Given how much work had been done prior to Geist 2E went on the Monday blogs and how quickly Geist 2E has been moving through the steps on the Monday Meetings blogs (1<sup>st</sup> posted at 1<sup>st</sup> Draft on Aug 29, 2017; 1<sup>st</sup> posted on Redlines on Jan 16, 2017; 1<sup>st</sup> posted on 2<sup>nd</sup> Draft on Feb 13, 2017; 1<sup>st</sup> posted on Development on June 26, 2017) I truly hope we\u2019ll see Geist going to WW for approvals in the next month and in Editing and art direction by Halloween. I\u2019d love to see it in pdf by Christmas, but given that the Geist anthology hasn\u2019t been written yet (unless that, like Geist 2E, a lot of work has already begun quietly without it showing on the onyx path blog) and Changeling 2E has yet to be published (though I\u2019m hoping the CtL2E kickstarter that\u2019s coming after GenCon may well be a sign of a move for that game line from editing to Post-Editing and Art Direction and a pdf by Halloween) I\u2019d conservatively guess at an early 2018 GtS 2<sup>nd</sup> edition advance pdf and hope for a late 2017 Christmas surprise <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> . And who knows? if the Changeling 2E kickstarter goes well, perhaps Geist 2E will get a kickstarter and we can all back it and see what goodies backers can sneak a peak at! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T18:23:00-07:00","id":1121123,"title":"","content":"Well we might get the full title of Geist: The Sin-Eaters Featuring the [Unrevealed] Chronicle. Can't say that I expect too much info on it in the brochure aside from maybe an updated book summary description for it. We could probably hope for some new info in an AMA or Q&amp;A panel during the con though.<br /> <br /> I think in terms of an anthology book it wouldn't be the only one in terms of having the corebook out before the anthology book though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T18:27:26-07:00","id":1121126,"title":"","content":"I don't know who the developer is but I bet they might give you some tidbits if you asked them at GenCon. There'll bound to be some info drops. I've found the brochures to be nice but sort of misleading, unfortunately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-26T18:33:35-07:00","id":1121128,"title":"","content":"Thanks Runcible and nofather!<br /> <br /> Good point about the anthology timing. Sadly I am unable to attend the Con this year. If anyone get's a chance to ask about the changes to the Sin-Eater X &amp; Y axis please do so and let me know here! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And if there's an audio recording of those panels, or links to those AMAs or other info drops, please do share them on the post here please. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" 