onyxpath.com/member/12845-ahather","name":"ahather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12845_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T15:30:19-07:00","id":1208218,"title":"","content":"speaking of playable ghosts. does anyone knows how a ghost in 1e could do the trick of phasing their hand inside someone's chest and pull their out by phasing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-17T15:36:13-07:00","id":1208220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ahather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1032849-what-we-know-so-far-geist-the-sin-eater-2nd-edition?p=1208212#post1208212\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">looking certain we will get playable ghosts next (27PG-8C) should be interesting</div> </div> </div> </div>To be real honest: I would not be sad Ceremonies wins. I've been interested in their new system and I loved their idea in 1st ed. <br /> <br /> But I'm LOVING the in depth deep dive into the dead. Ghosts and the underworld and the rivers and the dead societies are so much more interesting t