ing</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-08T12:29:29-07:00","id":1216766,"title":"","content":"Not even going to lie, this is truly exciting. I'm LOVING how 2E has turned out (from what's been released thus far) and cannot wait to get my players playing this from our 1.1 game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Kinda I want to&quot; - Trent Reznor<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent.ftpa1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/27973518_2040009129348529_5319855605701568493_n.jpg?oh=9c85c5c9d4a0769a1249ea2f3e62ca43&amp;oe=5B002AA5\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12143-eldritchminister","name":"EldritchMinister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12143_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T04:09:43-07:00","id":1217614,"title":"","content":"As we await the GtS 2E dev blog post on playable ghosts, I thought I'd list the various topics that have been voted on in past blogs:<br /> Bound v. Underworld (Bound won)<br /> Haunts &amp; Keys v. Synergy (Haunts &amp; Keys won)<br /> Mementos v. Ceremonies (Mementos won)<br /> Reapers v. Playable Ghosts (Reapers won)<br /> Underworld v. Living Antagonists (Underworld won)<br /> Playable Ghosts v. Ceremonies (Ghosts won)<br /> <br /> I've noticed that Ceremonies, Ghosts and the Underworld have been voted on twice. Given that, I hypothesize that the voting options that lost out the first time but have not been offered a second time may and likely will still return. So I'm thinking at some point before the KS, we will see a preview for: <br /> Synergy<br /> Ceremonies<br /> Living Antagonists<br /> <br /> I also hope we'll see a bit of insight into Psyche as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T13:45:58-07:00","id":1217765,"title":"","content":"I really want to see how the new Synergy works, it was one of the weaker things in 1e to my mind, it didn't mechanically fit what it was supposed to represent narratively. From what the blog posts have said about it too it sounds like it's taking on some of the work Psyche did (determining amount of Plasm you can spend per turn). I really hope it's kind of like Beast's Satiety in that there pros and cons to being at various levels of Synergy. Maybe the more the Geist is in control you can spend more plasm per turn, but are more affected by a Key's Doom or you pick up negative conditions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11057-sufferian","name":"sufferian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11057_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-11T13:49:40-07:00","id":1217767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1032849-what-we-know-so-far-geist-the-sin-eater-2nd-edition?p=1217614#post1217614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As we await the GtS 2E dev blog post on playable ghosts, I thought I'd list the various topics that have been voted on in past blogs:<br /> Bound v. Underworld (Bound won)<br /> Haunts &amp; Keys v. Synergy (Haunts &amp; Keys won)<br /> Mementos v. Ceremonies (Mementos won)<br /> Reapers v. Playable Ghosts (Reapers won)<br /> Underworld v. Living Antagonists (Underworld won)<br /> Playable Ghosts v. Ceremonies (Ghosts won)<br /> <br /> I've noticed that Ceremonies, Ghosts and the Underworld have been voted on twice. Given that, I hypothesize that the voting options that lost out the first time but have not been offered a second time may and likely will still return. So I'm thinking at some point before the KS, we will see a preview for: <br /> Synergy<br /> Ceremonies<br /> Living Antagonists<br /> <br /> I also hope we'll see a bit of insight into Psyche as well.</div> </div> </div> </div> That is reasonable and logical.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-12T17:15:14-07:00","id":1218102,"title":"","content":"Hm, good! If ghosts are playable now, this implies they also got improved as antagonists.<br /> In the first edition I always got the feeling they were a bit unfitted to be used as foe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T09:30:29-07:00","id":1218233,"title":"","content":"According to earlier teases, Ghosts themselves outside of specific cases like Reapers are not listed under the antagonist section of the book, but of course with the new ghost rules there's plenty of options to personalize ghost antagonists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5557-runcible","name":"Runcible","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5557_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"164"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-13T11:03:09-07:00","id":1218274,"title":"","co