r/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-17T09:11:33-07:00","id":1219672,"title":"","content":"Any word on the next preview?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-25T02:37:53-07:00","id":1221973,"title":"","content":"We know there are 10 Haunts: Boneyard, Caul, Curse, Dirge, Marionette, Memoria, Oracle, Rage, Shroud, and Tomb<br /> We know there are 5 Burdens: Abiding, Bereaved, Hungry, Kindly, and Vengeful<br /> We know that each Burden has a signature Haunt.<br /> My best guess: <br /> Abiding get Tomb. They want to leave a legacy behind, a monument in their memory. Says Tomb to me.<br /> Bereaved get Dirge. They mourn. They weep. They wail. Says Dirge to me.<br /> Hungry get Marionette They grasp at something in the world reaching to hold and control and keep. Says Marionette to me.<br /> Kindly get Shroud They seek to right a wrong or protect. Shroud seems the most defensive/protective to me.<br /> Vengeful get Rage They want payback. Says Rage to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-09T05:54:37-07:00","id":1226059