n__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How long is the period of time between the end of one kickstarter and the start of another usually?</div> </div> </div> </div>A month.<br /> <br /> For instance, the current KS, Realms of Pugmire's Fetch Quest, launched May 22nd. The one before that, Exalted's Dragon-Blooded, ended on April 26th. Looking at Fetch Quest's KS page, that campaign will close on June 20th.<br /> <br /> So, if Geist is the next KS, expect to see it open up in late July. Or about July 20th-31st.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-10T13:34:43-07:00","id":1226288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1032849-what-we-know-so-far-geist-the-sin-eater-2nd-edition?p=1226209#post1226209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A month.<br /> <br /> For instance, the current KS, Realms of Pugmire's Fetch Quest, launched May 22nd. The one before that, Exalted's Dragon-Blooded, ended on April 26th. Looking at Fetch Quest's KS page, that campaign will close on June 20th.<br /> <br /> So, if Geist is the next KS, expect to see it open up in late July. Or about July 20th-31st.</div> </div> </div> </div>That would be an AMAZING way to finish July <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-11T21:05:28-07:00","id":1226670,"title":"","content":"Monday's update says Geist KS ART is continuing! KS!!!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12074-robert-d","name":"Robert D","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-14T09:04:07-07:00","id":1227449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1032849-what-we-know-so-far-geist-the-sin-eater-2nd-edition?p=1226209#post1226209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A month.<br /> <br /> For instance, the current KS, Realms of Pugmire's Fetch Quest, launched May 22nd. The one before that, Exalted's Dragon-Blooded, ended on April 26th. Looking at Fetch Quest's KS page, that campaign will close on June 20th.<br /> <br /> So, if Geist is the next KS, expect to see it open up in late July. Or about July 20th-31st.</div> </div> </div> </div>This would be a pleasant surprise. I think historically onyx path doesn\u2019t run kickstarters during gen con. Though. Since they have someone specially manning them now. Well it would be nice to have a sin-eater kickstart sooner rather than later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24316,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24316-mrowl","user":"MrOwl","date":". 06-14-2018, 05:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24316-mrowl","name":"MrOwl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-18T19:58:59-07:00","id":1228475,"title":"","content":"The newest monday note certainly has some strong implications that Geist will be the next one on the block.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-19T10:21:38-07:00","id":1228617,"title":"","content":"Next one. For sure. But when. I\u2019d bet end of August/September. If they don\u2019t want to have to worry about it in July preceding gen con.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24316-mrowl","name":"MrOwl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member"